/* The marks of the tools that actually open this repository, and of the file
 * types the board is made of.
 *
 * Every path is the brand's own official mark, taken from Simple Icons
 * (simpleicons.org), which publishes the icon files under CC0. The marks
 * themselves stay the trademarks of their owners and are used here for one
 * purpose only: to name the tool that reads or writes a file. Folio is not
 * affiliated with, endorsed by, or a partner of any of them, and the page
 * never says otherwise.
 *
 * They are drawn in `currentColor`, never in brand colour. This page has a
 * token palette and one accent, and fifteen brand colours would turn a
 * hairline figure into a sponsor wall. The mark carries the recognition; the
 * colour is not needed for it.
 *
 * All paths are single-path, fill-rule default, on a 0 0 24 24 viewBox, so one
 * component renders any of them at any size. */

